<!-- Chairman Start -->
<div class="container-xxl py-5">
    <div class="container py-5 px-lg-5">
        <div class="wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.1s">
<p class="section-title text-secondary justify-content-center" style="font-size:20px; font-weight:bold;"><span></span>Our Chairman<span></span></p>
            <h1 class="text-center mb-5">Meet Our Chairman</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-8 col-md-10 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.1s">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <img class="img-fluid rounded-circle mb-4" src="~/img/chairman.png" alt="Chairman"  style="width: 350px; height: 350px;">
                    <h3>William James</h3>
                    <p class="text-muted"><strong style="font-size:18px;">Chairman, Star Security Services</strong></p>
                    <p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500;">William James, the visionary leader behind <span style="font-weight:bold; font-size:20px; color:#dc2028;">Star Security Services</span>, serves as the Chairman of the company. With over 20 years of experience in security management and law enforcement, he has played a crucial role in shaping the company’s reputation for excellence and reliability. William’s expertise in crisis management, surveillance systems, and corporate security has positioned Star Security Services as a trusted name in the industry. Under his leadership, the company has expanded its reach, adopting modern security innovations and building a team of highly skilled professionals dedicated to client safety.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- Chairman End -->

